1
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:35,990
[This drama is fictional
and bears no resemblance to reality]

2
00:00:35,990 --> 00:00:37,020
[Some scenes feature AI technology]

3
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:38,609
[All child and animal scenes
followed strict safety guidelines]

4
00:00:38,609 --> 00:00:41,527
[Episode 10]
<i>I'm funding Soo Bin's movie.</i>

5
00:00:41,527 --> 00:00:43,038
<i>I had something urgent to discuss.</i>

6
00:00:43,038 --> 00:00:45,784
<i>You really are crazy.</i>

7
00:00:45,784 --> 00:00:48,222
<i>That's why I dated a bastard like you.</i>

8
00:00:48,222 --> 00:00:49,647
<i>I didn't even know you were married.</i>

9
00:00:49,647 --> 00:00:51,101
<i>Still bitter about that?</i>

10
00:00:51,101 --> 00:00:54,027
<i>You got pregnant
and told me to divorce my wife.</i>

11
00:00:54,027 --> 00:00:59,920
<i>The audio you just heard is the controversial
recording spreading rapidly online.</i>

12
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:03,411
<i>The poster claims that An Su Hui,
a former Miss Korea, actress,</i>

13
00:01:03,411 --> 00:01:05,935
<i>now CEO of Topline, had an affair years ago</i>

14
00:01:05,935 --> 00:01:07,893
<i>with a married man, known only as Mr. A...</i>

15
00:01:07,893 --> 00:01:09,549
Everyone!

16
00:01:10,882 --> 00:01:13,913
I never thought I'd say this.

17
00:01:13,913 --> 00:01:17,473
Unplug every phone line. Now.

18
00:01:17,473 --> 00:01:20,310
Lock down the entrances. No one gets in.

19
00:01:20,310 --> 00:01:22,310
- Yes, sir.
- Got it.

20
00:01:25,053 --> 00:01:26,924
You're filming now, huh?

21
00:01:26,924 --> 00:01:29,136
Reporters will hit the set soon.

22
00:01:29,136 --> 00:01:30,670
The audio file is out.

23
00:01:30,670 --> 00:01:35,818
Did you know that
you and Director Ian are half-siblings?

24
00:01:36,495 --> 00:01:39,202
Are you really his half-sister?

25
00:01:39,202 --> 00:01:40,460
Did you know and still take the role?

26
00:01:40,460 --> 00:01:41,362
- Ms. Oh Ha Na.
- Please answer me.

27
00:01:41,362 --> 00:01:42,650
Please say something.

28
00:01:42,650 --> 00:01:45,363
- Please confirm whether it's true!
- Look this way, please!

29
00:01:45,363 --> 00:01:46,508
Could you look this way?

30
00:01:46,508 --> 00:01:48,713
What do you say
to the casting favoritism rumors?

31
00:01:48,713 --> 00:01:50,106
Ms. Oh Ha Na.

32
00:01:54,220 --> 00:01:55,741
Hold them back!

33
00:01:55,741 --> 00:01:56,660
CEO An!

34
00:01:56,660 --> 00:01:58,351
- An Su Hui!
- An Su Hui!

35
00:01:58,351 --> 00:02:00,601
- Please look this way!
- Move!

36
00:02:00,601 --> 00:02:03,167
Do you admit Ian Woo is your son?

37
00:02:03,167 --> 00:02:04,238
Please comment!

38
00:02:04,238 --> 00:02:06,165
- Is it true?
- Why did you invest in this film?

39
00:02:06,165 --> 00:02:07,538
Listen up.

40
00:02:07,538 --> 00:02:09,377
Do you know this is grounds for a lawsuit?

41
00:02:09,377 --> 00:02:11,521
How dare you storm this set?

42
00:02:11,521 --> 00:02:15,329
I'm remembering every face here.

43
00:02:16,030 --> 00:02:17,747
Hey, Reporter Park.

44
00:02:17,747 --> 00:02:20,321
You smelled a story and came running, huh?

45
00:02:20,321 --> 00:02:23,330
Bet you were thrilled the whole way here.

46
00:02:24,224 --> 00:02:27,165
What are you doing? Get back to work.

47
00:02:32,330 --> 00:02:34,060
Please give us an interview.

48
00:02:34,060 --> 00:02:35,701
Please say something.

49
00:02:35,701 --> 00:02:38,399
- Do you admit he's your son?
- An Su Hui!

50
00:02:45,399 --> 00:02:47,227
<i>She had an inappropriate relationship...</i>

51
00:02:47,227 --> 00:02:52,689
<i>and Ian Woo is said to be
the child born to them.</i>

52
00:02:53,417 --> 00:02:55,521
What is this?

53
00:02:55,521 --> 00:02:57,227
It's not true, right?

54
00:02:57,227 --> 00:02:59,441
It better not be.

55
00:03:02,051 --> 00:03:04,539
Mom!

56
00:03:04,539 --> 00:03:06,651
It has to be that bastard Director Kang.

57
00:03:06,651 --> 00:03:08,757
- Where the hell did he run...
- Ma'am.

58
00:03:08,757 --> 00:03:11,007
One of your people did this.

59
00:03:11,007 --> 00:03:13,151
So fix it.

60
00:03:13,151 --> 00:03:15,577
I'll focus on the film.

61
00:03:16,900 --> 00:03:20,098
You heard the director, right?

62
00:03:20,098 --> 00:03:22,951
If he's filming,
can his actress just leave the set?

63
00:03:22,951 --> 00:03:25,372
You said powerful people control time.

64
00:03:25,372 --> 00:03:27,643
Exactly. I'm the one with power.

65
00:03:27,643 --> 00:03:30,983
You're not there yet.

66
00:03:33,503 --> 00:03:36,583
Why am I the only one blindsided by this?

67
00:03:38,310 --> 00:03:40,987
I'll post guards and lock down the set.

68
00:03:40,987 --> 00:03:42,847
Keep filming without any delays.

69
00:03:42,847 --> 00:03:45,122
Are neither of you going to explain this to me?

70
00:03:45,122 --> 00:03:46,144
Oh Ha Na.

71
00:03:46,144 --> 00:03:47,864
Director Woo.

72
00:03:47,864 --> 00:03:50,102
Did you forget what I told you?

73
00:03:50,102 --> 00:03:52,712
I went to say that, and now look what happened.

74
00:03:52,712 --> 00:03:55,192
This is insane.

75
00:03:56,261 --> 00:03:58,718
- Ha Na...
- Let go of me!

76
00:03:58,718 --> 00:04:01,000
Before I lose it...

77
00:04:02,271 --> 00:04:03,944
What?

78
00:04:20,178 --> 00:04:21,758
Ha Na...

79
00:04:48,264 --> 00:04:50,048
Let's go. Hurry.

80
00:04:50,048 --> 00:04:51,872
Isn't that Oh Ha Na?

81
00:04:53,788 --> 00:04:56,032
Ms. Oh! How long have you known?

82
00:04:56,032 --> 00:05:00,289
Do you admit CEO An lobbied to get you cast?

83
00:05:29,642 --> 00:05:31,614
- Please say something!
- Please!

84
00:05:31,614 --> 00:05:33,942
Oh Ha Na!

85
00:05:33,942 --> 00:05:35,644
Go to my place for now.

86
00:05:35,644 --> 00:05:37,455
No one will look for you there.

87
00:05:37,455 --> 00:05:39,042
Please answer us.

88
00:05:39,042 --> 00:05:40,341
Just one comment!

89
00:05:40,341 --> 00:05:42,941
Please move!

90
00:05:45,234 --> 00:05:47,854
[Director Woo's Film "Gyeongseong Love Song"
Faces "Family Project" Controversy]

91
00:06:00,767 --> 00:06:02,238
Here's the revised schedule.

92
00:06:02,238 --> 00:06:06,084
I moved up every scene I could,
except Nan Young's.

93
00:06:12,988 --> 00:06:15,276
Are you okay?

94
00:06:15,276 --> 00:06:18,839
- I'm sorry.
- I asked if you were okay.

95
00:06:21,259 --> 00:06:23,199
I'm not.

96
00:06:30,535 --> 00:06:34,019
Take care of yourself right now.

97
00:06:34,019 --> 00:06:36,615
Leave the set to me.

98
00:06:39,206 --> 00:06:40,382
What?

99
00:06:40,382 --> 00:06:42,135
You don't trust me?

100
00:06:42,135 --> 00:06:46,433
Look at me. Still standing strong.

101
00:06:51,707 --> 00:06:54,059
And check on Ha Na too.

102
00:06:54,059 --> 00:06:58,266
Right now, you may be the one she needs.

103
00:07:04,458 --> 00:07:06,355
Soo Bin.

104
00:07:06,355 --> 00:07:09,155
You know the life Ha Na's had.

105
00:07:09,155 --> 00:07:13,032
So how could you do this to her?

106
00:07:13,032 --> 00:07:16,002
You cast her knowing everything.

107
00:07:16,002 --> 00:07:19,065
Would it have been okay
not to cast her for that?

108
00:07:19,065 --> 00:07:24,918
I thought it was wrong to pass on her
over a secret I couldn't share.

109
00:07:24,918 --> 00:07:28,364
I knew how much this film meant to her.

110
00:07:28,984 --> 00:07:30,188
Yeah.

111
00:07:30,188 --> 00:07:32,359
Maybe...

112
00:07:33,331 --> 00:07:37,598
I should've told her and let her choose.

113
00:07:37,598 --> 00:07:41,432
I didn't think it through.

114
00:07:51,930 --> 00:07:54,803
What will you do if you find her?

115
00:07:55,564 --> 00:07:58,497
Drag her back and make her shoot?

116
00:07:58,497 --> 00:08:01,027
Just shoot my scenes for now.

117
00:08:01,027 --> 00:08:02,706
I'll nail the emotional continuity.

118
00:08:02,706 --> 00:08:05,414
That's a given, you punk.

119
00:08:09,271 --> 00:08:13,501
While I'm gone, be good for Yi Jae.

120
00:08:13,501 --> 00:08:17,848
- What?
- I'm just as worried about Ha Na as you are.

121
00:08:17,848 --> 00:08:20,313
I don't think she should be alone.

122
00:08:22,860 --> 00:08:25,177
Let's skip this one...

123
00:08:25,177 --> 00:08:28,131
Nan Young is in this one too.

124
00:08:29,730 --> 00:08:33,242
Gosh... I'm losing my mind.

125
00:08:41,603 --> 00:08:42,663
[Choi Sa Rang]

126
00:08:45,803 --> 00:08:47,293
Hey.

127
00:08:47,293 --> 00:08:48,727
I'm okay.

128
00:08:48,727 --> 00:08:50,947
<i>What? Okay about what?</i>

129
00:08:50,947 --> 00:08:52,872
You didn't call about the article?

130
00:08:52,872 --> 00:08:54,622
<i>What article?</i>

131
00:08:56,904 --> 00:08:59,456
It's been worry calls all day.

132
00:08:59,456 --> 00:09:01,545
Your voice is a relief.

133
00:09:01,545 --> 00:09:02,985
<i>What do you mean?</i>

134
00:09:02,985 --> 00:09:05,333
- Did something happen?
<i>- Forget it.</i>

135
00:09:05,333 --> 00:09:07,749
Why are you calling at this hour?

136
00:09:07,749 --> 00:09:08,839
<i>Well...</i>

137
00:09:08,839 --> 00:09:11,613
I wanted to hear your voice before I left.

138
00:09:11,613 --> 00:09:14,628
You just wrapped. Going where?

139
00:09:15,653 --> 00:09:17,563
I quit my job.

140
00:09:17,563 --> 00:09:18,870
What?

141
00:09:18,870 --> 00:09:22,746
Before the first episode? What a waste.

142
00:09:22,746 --> 00:09:25,440
<i>I think I lived my life all wrong.</i>

143
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:26,897
You realize that now?

144
00:09:26,897 --> 00:09:28,565
Yeah.

145
00:09:28,565 --> 00:09:31,664
So I might go to Egypt.

146
00:09:31,664 --> 00:09:33,428
<i>Lots of tombs there.</i>

147
00:09:33,428 --> 00:09:36,792
What are you even saying?

148
00:09:37,642 --> 00:09:38,726
Wait.

149
00:09:38,726 --> 00:09:40,622
How about Gyeongseong?

150
00:09:40,622 --> 00:09:42,243
Come to our set.

151
00:09:42,243 --> 00:09:43,503
What?

152
00:09:43,503 --> 00:09:46,825
Why would I go there?

153
00:09:46,825 --> 00:09:49,461
Starting tomorrow,
I have to shoot without Soo Bin.

154
00:09:49,461 --> 00:09:51,341
Come help me with anything.

155
00:09:51,341 --> 00:09:53,594
Why are you shooting alone?

156
00:09:54,768 --> 00:09:57,840
No, wait. I'll look it up.

157
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:59,111
[Gyeongseong Love Song]

158
00:09:59,111 --> 00:10:00,627
[Gyeongseong Love Song in Chaos:
Ian Woo and Oh Ha Na "We're Siblings?"]

159
00:10:03,218 --> 00:10:05,425
Oh my... What is this?

160
00:10:05,425 --> 00:10:06,566
<i>See?</i>

161
00:10:06,566 --> 00:10:10,273
Whether you want to die or live,
do it on our set.

162
00:10:10,273 --> 00:10:12,003
<i>Perfect.</i>

163
00:10:12,003 --> 00:10:13,963
<i>You must be overwhelmed.</i>

164
00:10:13,963 --> 00:10:16,193
I need that too.

165
00:10:16,193 --> 00:10:18,217
I'm coming. Wait for me.

166
00:10:18,217 --> 00:10:19,744
Okay.

167
00:10:21,870 --> 00:10:23,683
Here we go...

168
00:10:31,451 --> 00:10:33,325
And then...

169
00:10:39,835 --> 00:10:40,999
Director Ju.

170
00:10:40,999 --> 00:10:42,886
You look tired.

171
00:10:42,886 --> 00:10:45,525
Try to get some sleep on the way.

172
00:10:45,525 --> 00:10:47,284
I'm okay.

173
00:10:52,930 --> 00:10:54,570
Producer Ye Seo.

174
00:10:55,370 --> 00:10:57,843
I can do this, right?

175
00:10:57,843 --> 00:11:00,994
It's my first time
shooting without Director Woo.

176
00:11:00,994 --> 00:11:04,908
Actually, I slept worse than
the night before my first shoot.

177
00:11:04,908 --> 00:11:07,601
Just do what you always do.

178
00:11:07,601 --> 00:11:09,891
I'll help all I can.

179
00:11:09,891 --> 00:11:11,251
Thank you.

180
00:11:11,251 --> 00:11:12,655
Oh, right.

181
00:11:12,655 --> 00:11:14,149
CEO Seo will be there today.

182
00:11:14,149 --> 00:11:16,343
I see.

183
00:11:24,942 --> 00:11:26,559
Good morning.

184
00:11:26,559 --> 00:11:28,039
- Hello.
- Hi.

185
00:11:28,039 --> 00:11:29,563
Hello, sir.

186
00:11:29,563 --> 00:11:30,839
Hello.

187
00:11:30,839 --> 00:11:32,716
Hello.

188
00:11:32,716 --> 00:11:34,089
Good morning.

189
00:11:34,089 --> 00:11:35,674
How are you?

190
00:11:35,674 --> 00:11:36,923
Director Ju.

191
00:11:36,923 --> 00:11:39,616
How is this a good morning?

192
00:11:39,616 --> 00:11:44,632
Because you're all here with me through this.

193
00:11:45,650 --> 00:11:48,201
Yeah, she's right.

194
00:11:48,201 --> 00:11:50,174
Good morning, Director Ju.

195
00:11:50,174 --> 00:11:52,250
Good morning!

196
00:11:53,206 --> 00:11:54,650
Sir,

197
00:11:54,650 --> 00:11:58,204
you worked so hard
fixing the schedule last minute.

198
00:11:58,204 --> 00:11:59,664
You always know what to do.

199
00:11:59,664 --> 00:12:01,186
"Fast, clean, and sharp."

200
00:12:01,186 --> 00:12:03,345
The god of schedules!

201
00:12:03,345 --> 00:12:06,399
- Come on. It's what I always do.
- Hold on!

202
00:12:06,399 --> 00:12:07,809
"Fast, clean..." and what?

203
00:12:07,809 --> 00:12:10,089
Say that again. I need to write it down.

204
00:12:10,089 --> 00:12:14,059
"Fast, clean, and sharp."

205
00:12:14,059 --> 00:12:19,228
You get me. You've got a Gen Z sense.

206
00:12:19,228 --> 00:12:22,002
Looks like our Gen Z guy needs reading glasses.

207
00:12:22,002 --> 00:12:24,729
- You got old eyes before I did.
- Jeez.

208
00:12:24,729 --> 00:12:26,542
Don't laugh.

209
00:12:26,542 --> 00:12:28,215
But...

210
00:12:28,215 --> 00:12:32,354
Are we really doing this
without Director Woo today?

211
00:12:33,388 --> 00:12:36,961
We don't know when he'll be back, right?

212
00:12:36,961 --> 00:12:38,700
Yes.

213
00:12:42,353 --> 00:12:45,918
I know you're worried.

214
00:12:45,918 --> 00:12:48,444
That's because I'm still lacking.

215
00:12:48,444 --> 00:12:54,168
But I'll do my best to fill his place.

216
00:12:54,168 --> 00:12:55,906
Please trust me.

217
00:12:55,906 --> 00:12:59,390
Sorry. That's not what I meant.

218
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:07,763
This old, worn-out paper is
the "Gyeongseong Love Song" manuscript.

219
00:13:07,763 --> 00:13:11,316
I keep it in my bag every time I come to set.

220
00:13:12,340 --> 00:13:17,798
So I don't forget how I felt
when I first wrote this story.

221
00:13:19,043 --> 00:13:21,511
This film is...

222
00:13:22,886 --> 00:13:25,273
a dream I've held onto for years.

223
00:13:25,273 --> 00:13:30,797
And walking this road with you
means more than I can say.

224
00:13:32,612 --> 00:13:36,698
So I won't waver.

225
00:13:36,698 --> 00:13:42,570
I want to make it to the end with you.

226
00:13:43,201 --> 00:13:48,091
Making it to the end is what makes this great.

227
00:13:48,911 --> 00:13:54,421
So at a time like this,
let's be one team and trust each other.

228
00:13:54,421 --> 00:13:56,354
Please.

229
00:14:01,221 --> 00:14:02,920
Just a moment!

230
00:14:09,689 --> 00:14:12,796
Director Woo told me.

231
00:14:12,796 --> 00:14:15,317
You started writing this in your senior year.

232
00:14:16,295 --> 00:14:20,026
I've had this dream since I was young too.

233
00:14:20,026 --> 00:14:24,792
I have hundreds of stories buried in a drawer.

234
00:14:25,737 --> 00:14:31,334
But you never gave up, did you?

235
00:14:33,183 --> 00:14:37,183
If it's you, I can follow you.

236
00:14:37,919 --> 00:14:39,786
Right, everyone?

237
00:14:39,786 --> 00:14:42,362
- That's right!
- Let's do this!

238
00:14:45,531 --> 00:14:46,702
We've got this!

239
00:14:46,702 --> 00:14:48,859
- Ju Yi Jae!
- Ju Yi Jae!

240
00:14:48,859 --> 00:14:51,343
- Let's go!
- Ju Yi Jae!

241
00:14:58,091 --> 00:14:59,754
Let's do this!

242
00:15:01,344 --> 00:15:06,317
Including Producer Nam,
we have 19 background extras.

243
00:15:06,317 --> 00:15:09,826
It'd be nice to have one or two more
in Western clothes.

244
00:15:09,826 --> 00:15:14,200
Producer Nam said
she'd try to convince CEO Seo.

245
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:16,314
- Even him?
- Yes.

246
00:15:17,167 --> 00:15:19,143
Ju Yi Jae!

247
00:15:20,967 --> 00:15:23,543
Director Ju!

248
00:15:25,763 --> 00:15:27,920
- Hey.
- I'm here.

249
00:15:27,920 --> 00:15:30,586
I'll help with anything. Just say the word.

250
00:15:30,586 --> 00:15:32,695
It's been ages!

251
00:15:32,695 --> 00:15:34,550
- You've been okay, huh?
- No.

252
00:15:34,550 --> 00:15:36,521
Why not?

253
00:15:36,521 --> 00:15:38,555
Who messed with you?

254
00:15:42,525 --> 00:15:45,488
You want me to be an extra?

255
00:15:45,488 --> 00:15:48,705
We need at least 20, and we're short.

256
00:15:48,705 --> 00:15:52,148
You know the schedule changed last night.

257
00:15:55,569 --> 00:15:59,935
I'm sure everyone will understand.

258
00:16:00,522 --> 00:16:01,849
Then excuse me.

259
00:16:01,849 --> 00:16:04,995
Please.

260
00:16:04,995 --> 00:16:07,173
I'm here as a producer.

261
00:16:07,173 --> 00:16:09,427
I'm a producer too!

262
00:16:09,427 --> 00:16:12,533
Please, just once.

263
00:16:12,533 --> 00:16:17,572
Honestly, you've barely been on set
because of that dating show.

264
00:16:17,572 --> 00:16:19,229
It's a secret.

265
00:16:19,229 --> 00:16:21,299
Who are you looking around for?

266
00:16:21,299 --> 00:16:25,540
Change quickly and get ready.

267
00:16:25,540 --> 00:16:28,503
This isn't just my problem.

268
00:16:29,120 --> 00:16:32,464
Director Ju must be on edge.

269
00:16:32,464 --> 00:16:35,334
The least we can do is help.

270
00:16:45,058 --> 00:16:49,744
A modern boy who steals the hearts
of Gyeongseong's modern girls...

271
00:16:49,744 --> 00:16:52,669
He believes the world is only beautiful,

272
00:16:52,669 --> 00:16:56,182
then vanishes tragically. Right?

273
00:16:56,182 --> 00:16:58,087
Yes, great. That's it.

274
00:16:58,087 --> 00:17:01,979
Get shot and die like that, okay?

275
00:17:04,296 --> 00:17:06,198
Excuse me, lady.

276
00:17:06,198 --> 00:17:08,596
Where should I change?

277
00:17:10,246 --> 00:17:12,344
You can change in the waiting room inside.

278
00:17:12,344 --> 00:17:14,130
Much obliged.

279
00:17:21,085 --> 00:17:25,263
Making a TV writer act now? Jeez.

280
00:17:30,361 --> 00:17:31,371
Oh my.

281
00:17:31,371 --> 00:17:34,101
I already feel tragic.

282
00:17:34,101 --> 00:17:36,782
Brains and beauty...

283
00:17:36,782 --> 00:17:42,774
Gyeongseong's top club singer,
doomed to a tragic life.

284
00:17:44,294 --> 00:17:49,121
I'd love to shoot
one Japanese bastard in style.

285
00:17:52,128 --> 00:17:53,749
Sorry.

286
00:18:01,100 --> 00:18:02,934
No way...

287
00:18:08,411 --> 00:18:10,134
Ready!

288
00:18:10,134 --> 00:18:11,993
Fire!

289
00:18:20,508 --> 00:18:23,706
Long live Korean indepen...

290
00:18:29,585 --> 00:18:31,331
Sa Rang?

291
00:18:34,811 --> 00:18:36,305
Cut!

292
00:18:36,305 --> 00:18:38,381
What are you two doing?

293
00:18:38,381 --> 00:18:39,608
Cut!

294
00:18:39,608 --> 00:18:41,092
Why is a dead person getting up?

295
00:18:41,092 --> 00:18:43,679
Who was that? Who just moved?

296
00:18:43,679 --> 00:18:44,719
Sorry.

297
00:18:44,719 --> 00:18:46,069
CEO Seo?

298
00:18:46,069 --> 00:18:47,862
Sorry.

299
00:18:48,548 --> 00:18:50,473
I'm sorry.

300
00:18:50,473 --> 00:18:52,335
Writer Choi?

301
00:18:52,335 --> 00:18:53,592
Sorry.

302
00:18:53,592 --> 00:18:55,266
Sa Rang.

303
00:19:01,048 --> 00:19:06,379
I had no idea Yi Jae's film
was from your company.

304
00:19:06,379 --> 00:19:08,344
Neither did I.

305
00:19:08,344 --> 00:19:12,919
That we'd meet again lying dead in the dirt.

306
00:19:16,651 --> 00:19:20,084
I promised myself if we ever met again,

307
00:19:23,257 --> 00:19:26,208
I'd just walk past you coldly.

308
00:19:26,208 --> 00:19:28,444
No look. No hello.

309
00:19:31,855 --> 00:19:35,373
Now this just feels so empty.

310
00:19:39,262 --> 00:19:40,480
"Empty?"

311
00:19:40,480 --> 00:19:42,824
Why did we break up?

312
00:19:44,082 --> 00:19:48,385
Before we say goodbye,
please tell me that much.

313
00:19:54,042 --> 00:19:59,603
I took it lightly, the way I always do,
and got burned badly.

314
00:20:00,834 --> 00:20:04,945
You keep making my life difficult.

315
00:20:05,622 --> 00:20:08,386
You break my rules.

316
00:20:08,386 --> 00:20:10,721
You make me misread everything.

317
00:20:15,136 --> 00:20:18,818
What if that's because you love me?

318
00:20:21,677 --> 00:20:23,876
If this is love...

319
00:20:28,089 --> 00:20:30,936
I don't think I can handle it.

320
00:20:32,063 --> 00:20:36,524
I still... like things easy.

321
00:20:39,500 --> 00:20:41,680
All right.

322
00:20:41,680 --> 00:20:47,680
I may not understand it, but I can accept it.

323
00:20:48,467 --> 00:20:50,100
Then...

324
00:20:51,308 --> 00:20:53,859
Let's say goodbye here.

325
00:20:56,060 --> 00:20:57,900
Be well.

326
00:21:00,241 --> 00:21:02,774
Why are you talking like that?

327
00:21:03,375 --> 00:21:07,043
Must be the power of this outfit.

328
00:21:10,181 --> 00:21:12,892
That is so you, right to the end.

329
00:21:12,892 --> 00:21:14,918
Take care.

330
00:21:14,918 --> 00:21:16,718
I mean it.

331
00:21:18,063 --> 00:21:22,635
Since this is goodbye, why don't you go first?

332
00:21:23,704 --> 00:21:29,015
You look more beautiful walking away than I do.

333
00:21:29,015 --> 00:21:33,313
Let's make our final moment beautiful.

334
00:21:33,313 --> 00:21:36,595
I like watching you walk away too.

335
00:21:36,595 --> 00:21:39,384
Did you forget how we met?

336
00:21:39,384 --> 00:21:41,791
Then we're tied.

337
00:21:43,178 --> 00:21:46,483
Should we turn around together?

338
00:21:46,483 --> 00:21:48,067
Sounds good.

339
00:21:49,428 --> 00:21:51,267
One.

340
00:21:51,267 --> 00:21:52,617
Two.

341
00:21:53,361 --> 00:21:54,746
Three.

342
00:23:03,092 --> 00:23:05,666
I should have had you hold my hand...

343
00:23:07,526 --> 00:23:09,947
not a gun.

344
00:23:12,926 --> 00:23:15,790
How can I protect my country...

345
00:23:15,790 --> 00:23:16,807
<i>Cut!</i>

346
00:23:16,807 --> 00:23:20,870
Moo Gyeom, move closer
to the flag and crumple it.

347
00:23:20,870 --> 00:23:23,167
Cut! Let's go again.

348
00:23:23,167 --> 00:23:24,207
Yeah.

349
00:23:24,207 --> 00:23:26,391
- How can I protect my country...
<i>- Cut!</i>

350
00:23:26,391 --> 00:23:28,417
- How can I protect my country...
<i>- Cut!</i>

351
00:23:28,417 --> 00:23:31,250
- How can I protect my...
<i>- Cut!</i>

352
00:23:32,024 --> 00:23:33,677
When I couldn't even protect you...

353
00:23:33,677 --> 00:23:34,941
Cut! Let's go again.

354
00:23:34,941 --> 00:23:39,043
Moo Gyeom, the telegram's out of frame.
Hold it a little higher.

355
00:23:39,043 --> 00:23:41,547
When I couldn't even protect you...

356
00:23:43,057 --> 00:23:44,801
<i>Cut.</i>

357
00:23:44,801 --> 00:23:50,514
I think you should walk to the table
and finish there.

358
00:23:54,575 --> 00:23:56,055
<i>Cut!</i>

359
00:23:57,616 --> 00:24:01,686
Sorry, everyone. One more take!

360
00:24:01,686 --> 00:24:03,500
Well...

361
00:24:03,500 --> 00:24:06,171
Keep the blocking from the last take.

362
00:24:06,171 --> 00:24:09,355
Stay more upright, so you don't cast a shadow.

363
00:24:09,355 --> 00:24:13,689
And use the emotion from the first take.

364
00:24:15,607 --> 00:24:17,238
Yi Jae.

365
00:24:17,238 --> 00:24:19,231
It's okay.

366
00:24:19,231 --> 00:24:20,930
Just breathe.

367
00:24:22,433 --> 00:24:23,791
Okay.

368
00:24:24,856 --> 00:24:26,768
Let's go again!

369
00:24:26,768 --> 00:24:29,070
One more take!

370
00:24:29,070 --> 00:24:31,940
"She built a career on her good-mother image,

371
00:24:31,940 --> 00:24:34,672
but she had a hidden son?"

372
00:24:34,672 --> 00:24:36,569
"I feel bad for the son."

373
00:24:36,569 --> 00:24:39,489
"An Su Hui, the homewrecker, should step down."

374
00:24:39,489 --> 00:24:41,299
"Her face says it all.

375
00:24:41,299 --> 00:24:43,746
She looks vicious..."

376
00:24:43,746 --> 00:24:44,850
That's all.

377
00:24:44,850 --> 00:24:47,203
Guess I'll live forever.

378
00:24:47,203 --> 00:24:47,871
Next.

379
00:24:47,871 --> 00:24:51,180
The most urgent issue is Ha Na's ad contracts.

380
00:24:51,180 --> 00:24:54,703
Cosmetics, sportswear, phones, even banking...

381
00:24:54,703 --> 00:24:56,557
They all want to terminate.

382
00:24:56,557 --> 00:24:58,261
Empty threats.

383
00:24:58,261 --> 00:25:00,057
What did Ha Na do wrong?

384
00:25:00,057 --> 00:25:03,734
Advertisers are sensitive to public opinion.

385
00:25:03,734 --> 00:25:08,730
Ha Na is getting far more attention
than you or Director Woo.

386
00:25:08,730 --> 00:25:11,548
Rumors about co-star feuds, power trips,

387
00:25:11,548 --> 00:25:14,238
even her acting skills are all resurfacing.

388
00:25:14,238 --> 00:25:16,685
They really saw their chance.

389
00:25:16,685 --> 00:25:18,709
We're taking legal action against all of them.

390
00:25:18,709 --> 00:25:20,480
- Yes, ma'am.
- Yes, ma'am.

391
00:25:21,454 --> 00:25:23,318
Team Lead Han.

392
00:25:23,318 --> 00:25:28,419
Tell Director Kang to crawl back here
before I go find him.

393
00:25:28,419 --> 00:25:30,361
Sorry?

394
00:25:30,361 --> 00:25:32,986
Why me...

395
00:25:32,986 --> 00:25:34,059
Curious?

396
00:25:34,059 --> 00:25:35,683
You really want me to say it?

397
00:25:35,683 --> 00:25:39,008
No, ma'am. I'll tell him.

398
00:25:39,820 --> 00:25:41,782
Everyone, leave.

399
00:25:48,913 --> 00:25:50,117
Yeah.

400
00:25:50,117 --> 00:25:52,550
So... where is she?

401
00:25:52,550 --> 00:25:55,129
I really don't know.

402
00:25:55,129 --> 00:25:58,932
She said you'd know right away if I lied,

403
00:25:58,932 --> 00:26:02,167
so she wouldn't tell me until the end.

404
00:26:02,822 --> 00:26:04,986
Beats me.

405
00:26:05,970 --> 00:26:09,986
Is she in touch with you?

406
00:26:09,986 --> 00:26:12,617
Check in every hour and report to me.

407
00:26:12,617 --> 00:26:14,104
Yes...

408
00:26:21,119 --> 00:26:23,812
[Am I the only one happy
Oh Ha Na got canceled? LOL]

409
00:26:23,812 --> 00:26:26,134
[She coasted into lead roles thanks to her mom]

410
00:26:26,134 --> 00:26:28,158
[If that were me, I'd die of shame]

411
00:26:28,158 --> 00:26:31,566
[She rose as An Su Hui's daughter,
and she'll fall as An Su Hui's daughter]

412
00:26:40,128 --> 00:26:41,785
[Sim Yu Geon]

413
00:26:41,785 --> 00:26:44,316
<i>You can eat anything in the fridge.</i>

414
00:26:44,316 --> 00:26:45,731
<i>Don't skip meals.</i>

415
00:26:45,731 --> 00:26:47,065
<i>Make sure you eat.</i>

416
00:26:47,065 --> 00:26:50,019
You think I can eat right now?

417
00:27:03,571 --> 00:27:06,037
What am I supposed to eat?

418
00:27:20,686 --> 00:27:23,083
He didn't throw it away...

419
00:27:25,465 --> 00:27:29,341
I think I need that shoulder right now.

420
00:27:43,754 --> 00:27:45,604
Oh Ha Na.

421
00:27:45,604 --> 00:27:47,154
It's me.

422
00:27:50,936 --> 00:27:52,875
What?

423
00:27:52,875 --> 00:27:54,815
Hated or not, I'm hungry.

424
00:27:54,815 --> 00:27:56,169
Yeah.

425
00:27:56,755 --> 00:27:58,604
Chew slowly.

426
00:28:03,598 --> 00:28:06,795
You came just to sit there?

427
00:28:08,552 --> 00:28:10,249
I'm taking care of myself.

428
00:28:10,249 --> 00:28:12,309
- What?
- Yi Jae told me to.

429
00:28:12,309 --> 00:28:15,009
And she told me to look after you too.

430
00:28:18,514 --> 00:28:21,631
I think I've done enough for myself.

431
00:28:21,631 --> 00:28:23,891
So how should I look after you?

432
00:28:23,891 --> 00:28:25,261
I don't know.

433
00:28:25,261 --> 00:28:28,083
No wonder I hated you from the start.

434
00:28:28,083 --> 00:28:29,741
My blood was rejecting you.

435
00:28:29,741 --> 00:28:30,858
No.

436
00:28:30,858 --> 00:28:32,685
You just didn't like me.

437
00:28:32,685 --> 00:28:33,982
Right.

438
00:28:33,982 --> 00:28:36,405
- You're so annoying.
- So are you.

439
00:28:37,085 --> 00:28:39,669
I'm already upset
about being everyone's punching bag.

440
00:28:39,669 --> 00:28:41,669
Did you come here to pick a fight?

441
00:28:42,310 --> 00:28:43,867
You're not used to it yet?

442
00:28:43,867 --> 00:28:45,267
You've been a star your whole life.

443
00:28:45,267 --> 00:28:50,221
I didn't know people saw me as this awful.

444
00:28:50,221 --> 00:28:54,319
They're attacking me like
they've waited for this moment.

445
00:28:54,987 --> 00:28:59,364
Like I deserve it
because of everything I got from Mom.

446
00:28:59,364 --> 00:29:00,804
Oh Ha Na.

447
00:29:03,051 --> 00:29:05,844
Don't aim your anger at the wrong target.

448
00:29:06,722 --> 00:29:10,544
Those people aren't why you're hurt. CEO An is.

449
00:29:11,151 --> 00:29:14,145
She wanted you to never find out.

450
00:29:14,145 --> 00:29:18,545
That's why she came to see me
and ran into my father.

451
00:29:18,545 --> 00:29:19,962
That conversation got recorded.

452
00:29:19,962 --> 00:29:22,858
Why wasn't I supposed to know?

453
00:29:22,858 --> 00:29:24,487
Am I not family?

454
00:29:24,487 --> 00:29:26,617
Because you are family.

455
00:29:28,036 --> 00:29:32,297
You and CEO An are family.

456
00:29:34,608 --> 00:29:37,930
That's why I thought
you didn't need to know either.

457
00:29:40,269 --> 00:29:42,915
Nothing changes from here on out.

458
00:29:45,354 --> 00:29:49,986
Still, I think you need time
to accept all this.

459
00:29:53,377 --> 00:29:55,627
I won't rush you.

460
00:29:55,627 --> 00:30:00,276
Once you've taken care of yourself,
let's go back to set.

461
00:30:02,060 --> 00:30:03,744
Sleep well.

462
00:30:04,344 --> 00:30:06,147
I'll come again tomorrow.

463
00:30:09,495 --> 00:30:12,375
Why would you come tomorrow?

464
00:30:15,438 --> 00:30:18,867
I'm coming every day
until you say you'll shoot.

465
00:30:18,867 --> 00:30:20,969
Seriously...

466
00:30:21,731 --> 00:30:25,174
Why did Yu Geon send me here, then?

467
00:30:25,174 --> 00:30:27,476
He said nobody would find me.

468
00:30:31,260 --> 00:30:35,364
I had to put up with his attitude
to find out you were here.

469
00:30:35,364 --> 00:30:37,254
Yu Geon has attitude?

470
00:30:37,254 --> 00:30:39,248
His personality is not great.

471
00:30:39,248 --> 00:30:41,792
- As bad as yours?
- What?

472
00:30:41,792 --> 00:30:43,177
- "You?"
- Director...

473
00:30:43,177 --> 00:30:45,348
Right. Show some respect.

474
00:30:45,348 --> 00:30:47,399
Want anything to eat?

475
00:30:48,184 --> 00:30:51,350
- I'll bring it on my way here.
- Director.

476
00:30:51,350 --> 00:30:53,505
I'm not going to die.

477
00:30:54,099 --> 00:30:56,904
You know what I did
to win the role of Nan Young.

478
00:30:58,416 --> 00:31:01,780
So stop doing things that don't suit you.

479
00:31:04,274 --> 00:31:05,911
Good.

480
00:31:05,911 --> 00:31:07,534
That's a relief.

481
00:31:08,202 --> 00:31:09,912
Oh Ha Na.

482
00:31:09,912 --> 00:31:13,957
Let's make it to a happy ending together.

483
00:31:13,957 --> 00:31:15,337
Bye.

484
00:31:35,553 --> 00:31:37,503
I'm here to see CEO An now.

485
00:31:37,503 --> 00:31:39,519
I'll try to persuade her.

486
00:31:40,810 --> 00:31:43,868
Please talk to the other investors

487
00:31:43,868 --> 00:31:46,094
- and buy us some time.
<i>- CEO Seo.</i>

488
00:31:46,094 --> 00:31:48,682
<i>Buying time won't fix this.</i>

489
00:31:48,682 --> 00:31:51,268
<i>Tell her to issue a statement now.</i>

490
00:31:51,268 --> 00:31:53,405
<i>Avoiding it won't fix this.</i>

491
00:31:53,405 --> 00:31:55,405
I understand.

492
00:31:56,068 --> 00:31:58,043
I'll call you back.

493
00:31:58,043 --> 00:31:59,292
Bye.

494
00:32:09,346 --> 00:32:10,929
Ma'am.

495
00:32:10,929 --> 00:32:12,556
It's already been a week.

496
00:32:12,556 --> 00:32:16,323
The investors say they can't wait any longer.

497
00:32:16,323 --> 00:32:18,800
They waited one week.

498
00:32:18,800 --> 00:32:20,148
They can't wait two?

499
00:32:20,148 --> 00:32:22,284
Public opinion keeps getting worse.

500
00:32:22,284 --> 00:32:26,802
They want you to issue a statement immediately.

501
00:32:34,505 --> 00:32:36,383
They want me to what?

502
00:32:36,383 --> 00:32:38,250
I'm the lead investor.

503
00:32:38,250 --> 00:32:41,581
They chip in a little money
and think they can order me around?

504
00:32:42,275 --> 00:32:43,556
Ma'am...

505
00:32:43,556 --> 00:32:47,206
This isn't about the amount of money.

506
00:32:47,206 --> 00:32:49,745
People are losing faith in the film.

507
00:32:49,745 --> 00:32:54,425
The longer you stay silent,
the more aggressive the press gets.

508
00:32:54,425 --> 00:32:56,990
The moment I admit it,

509
00:32:56,990 --> 00:33:00,510
I become prey for starving beasts.

510
00:33:00,510 --> 00:33:03,073
You want me to do that?

511
00:33:03,073 --> 00:33:05,068
I've spent years in this business.

512
00:33:05,068 --> 00:33:08,387
A scandal like this will fade with time.

513
00:33:08,387 --> 00:33:10,974
Then at least look at this.

514
00:33:10,974 --> 00:33:15,860
It's a notice from the investment fund.

515
00:33:16,576 --> 00:33:18,437
[Notice: Additional Investment Withheld]
Ma'am...

516
00:33:18,437 --> 00:33:20,717
You need to decide now.

517
00:33:20,717 --> 00:33:25,650
Otherwise...
we'll have to halt filming immediately.

518
00:33:41,999 --> 00:33:44,296
- Where should we set the rickshaw?
- Yeah.

519
00:33:44,296 --> 00:33:46,320
Let's see...

520
00:33:46,320 --> 00:33:48,350
- Please put it at the far end.
- Okay.

521
00:33:48,350 --> 00:33:50,125
Thank you.

522
00:33:57,327 --> 00:33:58,225
It's snowing!

523
00:33:58,225 --> 00:34:01,481
- Snow's just a hassle.
- First snow!

524
00:34:03,117 --> 00:34:04,368
Director Ju.

525
00:34:04,368 --> 00:34:06,338
Should we stand by?

526
00:34:06,338 --> 00:34:08,435
Should we shoot the interior scenes first?

527
00:34:08,435 --> 00:34:10,772
The snow looks like it'll pile up fast.

528
00:34:20,436 --> 00:34:24,240
Then for now...

529
00:34:24,240 --> 00:34:26,290
Let's hold for 30 minutes.

530
00:34:26,290 --> 00:34:28,043
30-minute hold!

531
00:34:28,043 --> 00:34:30,983
- Cover the equipment with plastic!
- Cover the equipment!

532
00:35:15,153 --> 00:35:16,834
Director Ju!

533
00:35:18,742 --> 00:35:20,512
Director Ju...

534
00:35:25,536 --> 00:35:27,246
Everyone.

535
00:35:27,246 --> 00:35:29,647
"Gyeongseong Love Song"

536
00:35:29,647 --> 00:35:33,755
will be put on hold for now.

537
00:35:37,137 --> 00:35:40,107
Due to several issues,

538
00:35:40,107 --> 00:35:43,281
there's a problem with the funding.

539
00:35:43,281 --> 00:35:48,451
Your wages will be paid through today.

540
00:35:48,451 --> 00:35:51,566
So please don't worry about that.

541
00:35:54,043 --> 00:35:58,190
As the director, I'm truly sorry.

542
00:35:59,253 --> 00:36:01,975
I'll resolve this as quickly as I can

543
00:36:02,742 --> 00:36:05,040
so you can all come back.

544
00:36:05,040 --> 00:36:07,228
I'll do everything I can.

545
00:36:08,156 --> 00:36:11,749
I'm truly sorry.

546
00:36:24,098 --> 00:36:25,242
Hey.

547
00:36:25,242 --> 00:36:27,788
Want to come with me to Director Jeong's set?

548
00:36:28,691 --> 00:36:31,735
- They have an opening?
- You little brats.

549
00:36:31,735 --> 00:36:33,445
You should come too.

550
00:36:33,445 --> 00:36:35,708
You came up under Director Jeong.

551
00:36:35,708 --> 00:36:38,215
Have some loyalty.

552
00:36:38,215 --> 00:36:40,655
We should wait at least a week.

553
00:36:40,655 --> 00:36:44,338
Life's hard, so I have to look out for myself.

554
00:36:44,338 --> 00:36:46,873
Yeah, well...

555
00:36:47,534 --> 00:36:50,384
We can't blame you for that.

556
00:36:50,384 --> 00:36:52,963
The snow is nice, though.

557
00:36:52,963 --> 00:36:54,999
Man, this feels bitter.

558
00:36:54,999 --> 00:36:59,015
Just when we were finally
getting in sync with Director Ju.

559
00:36:59,015 --> 00:37:03,211
It really passed like a brief dream.

560
00:37:03,211 --> 00:37:05,244
I'm coming back.

561
00:37:07,561 --> 00:37:10,290
Didn't we promise Director Ju?

562
00:37:12,636 --> 00:37:14,632
To go all the way together.

563
00:37:15,610 --> 00:37:17,923
Wait for me.

564
00:37:20,311 --> 00:37:22,653
I'm coming too!

565
00:37:53,690 --> 00:37:55,734
<i>Ready...</i>

566
00:37:55,734 --> 00:37:57,355
<i>Action!</i>

567
00:38:00,875 --> 00:38:03,160
<i>- Ju Yi Jae!
- Ju Yi Jae!</i>

568
00:38:03,160 --> 00:38:05,387
<i>Let's go, Yi Jae!</i>

569
00:38:20,009 --> 00:38:21,894
[Gyeongseong Love Song]

570
00:38:45,703 --> 00:38:47,223
Yi Jae.

571
00:39:52,188 --> 00:39:55,448
<i>Yi Jae, I'm going to see CEO An.</i>

572
00:39:56,048 --> 00:39:57,652
<i>Don't worry.</i>

573
00:39:57,652 --> 00:39:59,734
<i>I'll fix everything.</i>

574
00:40:02,906 --> 00:40:05,825
You asked me that day why I cast Ha Na.

575
00:40:07,071 --> 00:40:12,475
Ha Na said her world felt like a prison.

576
00:40:12,475 --> 00:40:16,352
She wanted to blow up
that prison herself, like Nan Young.

577
00:40:16,352 --> 00:40:19,425
And reach her happy ending.

578
00:40:19,425 --> 00:40:23,108
That's why I cast her.

579
00:40:24,363 --> 00:40:26,698
Because I know that kind of life

580
00:40:28,010 --> 00:40:30,665
better than anyone.

581
00:40:38,028 --> 00:40:40,218
What do you think?

582
00:40:40,218 --> 00:40:44,205
Can Ha Na reach her happy ending now?

583
00:40:44,205 --> 00:40:48,024
Are you using her to threaten me?

584
00:40:48,024 --> 00:40:50,742
Does wishing your daughter happiness...

585
00:40:51,535 --> 00:40:53,701
sound like a threat?

586
00:40:55,672 --> 00:41:01,418
If I admit what happened,
that will only hurt her.

587
00:41:01,418 --> 00:41:06,023
You think people will understand us
just because we tell the truth?

588
00:41:06,023 --> 00:41:08,274
They'll pounce.

589
00:41:08,274 --> 00:41:11,014
Why does that matter?

590
00:41:11,014 --> 00:41:15,700
Think carefully about what she truly wants.

591
00:41:18,266 --> 00:41:21,830
In three days, whether you come or not,

592
00:41:21,830 --> 00:41:24,586
the press conference will go ahead as planned.

593
00:41:25,710 --> 00:41:27,343
Hey!

594
00:41:28,338 --> 00:41:32,599
Then what are you doing this for?

595
00:41:33,337 --> 00:41:37,373
Why drag something so shameful into the open?

596
00:41:46,695 --> 00:41:48,220
Because...

597
00:41:49,801 --> 00:41:52,303
I also want a happy ending

598
00:41:53,016 --> 00:41:55,350
with the person I love.

599
00:42:12,863 --> 00:42:14,300
Yes?

600
00:42:17,543 --> 00:42:19,876
Want me to tie it?

601
00:42:19,876 --> 00:42:21,089
Sure.

602
00:42:27,245 --> 00:42:30,214
Any word from CEO An?

603
00:42:30,214 --> 00:42:32,126
No.

604
00:42:32,126 --> 00:42:34,179
Will you be okay alone?

605
00:42:36,273 --> 00:42:37,913
Woo Soo Bin.

606
00:42:38,499 --> 00:42:41,284
Did you think about what I said?

607
00:42:41,284 --> 00:42:43,637
These days, with crowdfunding...

608
00:42:43,637 --> 00:42:44,949
I know.

609
00:42:44,949 --> 00:42:46,599
I do.

610
00:42:47,523 --> 00:42:50,550
But I came back so I wouldn't run anymore.

611
00:42:51,321 --> 00:42:55,632
And this film I'm making with you is my proof.

612
00:42:56,739 --> 00:42:59,397
Let me try everything I can first.

613
00:42:59,397 --> 00:43:01,552
Then we'll find another way.

614
00:43:04,890 --> 00:43:07,043
- And, Yi Jae.
- Yeah?

615
00:43:07,043 --> 00:43:09,543
You don't know how to tie a tie, huh?

616
00:43:09,543 --> 00:43:10,687
No.

617
00:43:10,687 --> 00:43:12,272
I'll do it.

618
00:43:13,427 --> 00:43:15,191
It's not working.

619
00:43:30,517 --> 00:43:32,035
Grandma.

620
00:43:33,610 --> 00:43:35,350
You're here.

621
00:43:37,737 --> 00:43:39,480
Where's Mom?

622
00:43:42,800 --> 00:43:44,490
She's gone.

623
00:43:44,490 --> 00:43:46,057
What?

624
00:43:46,057 --> 00:43:47,530
Where?

625
00:43:58,478 --> 00:44:01,224
She told me to give this to you.

626
00:44:05,759 --> 00:44:07,486
Soo Bin.

627
00:44:08,333 --> 00:44:11,619
Don't resent her too much.

628
00:44:11,619 --> 00:44:13,439
Hwa Yeon...

629
00:44:15,659 --> 00:44:18,116
She tried so hard.

630
00:44:37,407 --> 00:44:40,999
<i>My beloved son, Soo Bin.</i>

631
00:44:42,808 --> 00:44:45,368
<i>Please forgive your mom.</i>

632
00:44:48,127 --> 00:44:55,480
<i>Forgive me for not taking your hand
and getting us out of that hell.</i>

633
00:44:56,748 --> 00:44:59,585
<i>- Good, right?
- Mom, you're the best.</i>

634
00:44:59,585 --> 00:45:07,502
<i>Forgive me for being happy
because I had you, even knowing it was hell.</i>

635
00:45:08,685 --> 00:45:16,076
<i>Forgive me for not leaving your side
because you were my only happiness.</i>

636
00:45:16,904 --> 00:45:19,778
<i>I realized far too late...</i>

637
00:45:20,751 --> 00:45:22,727
<i>That I was the one</i>

638
00:45:23,874 --> 00:45:27,707
<i>keeping you trapped in that hell.</i>

639
00:45:29,521 --> 00:45:31,687
<i>My son, Soo Bin.</i>

640
00:45:32,854 --> 00:45:37,799
<i>Don't forgive me.</i>

641
00:46:05,115 --> 00:46:06,936
[Director Woo Soo Bin Press Conference]
[Official Statement]

642
00:46:14,091 --> 00:46:19,060
First, CEO An Su Hui is my birth mother.

643
00:46:20,535 --> 00:46:24,011
But she was never my mother.
Not even for a moment.

644
00:46:27,122 --> 00:46:29,340
I have only one mother.

645
00:46:30,305 --> 00:46:33,608
The woman who raised me with love.

646
00:46:35,135 --> 00:46:40,651
I was afraid even saying this
would hurt my mother.

647
00:46:41,922 --> 00:46:45,174
But I'm here today for one reason.

648
00:46:46,722 --> 00:46:51,647
The film I'm shooting has been badly affected.

649
00:46:54,024 --> 00:46:56,783
A film does not belong to me alone.

650
00:46:56,783 --> 00:47:02,089
It is built on the time and effort
of countless cast and crew.

651
00:47:02,701 --> 00:47:05,485
I'm here to protect that work

652
00:47:05,485 --> 00:47:09,699
from baseless speculation
and unverified claims.

653
00:47:12,103 --> 00:47:14,127
I will answer your questions
as sincerely as I can.

654
00:47:14,127 --> 00:47:15,217
Director Woo.

655
00:47:15,217 --> 00:47:19,310
What do you mean she was never your mother?

656
00:47:19,310 --> 00:47:21,743
Please be specific.

657
00:47:22,430 --> 00:47:27,207
I learned about my birth mother around age ten.

658
00:47:27,207 --> 00:47:30,242
Even after that, we had no contact.

659
00:47:30,242 --> 00:47:33,461
Then did you have no personal relationship
with Oh Ha Na either?

660
00:47:33,461 --> 00:47:34,485
No.

661
00:47:34,485 --> 00:47:40,451
Until this issue came up,
she knew nothing about me and CEO An.

662
00:47:40,451 --> 00:47:44,251
There are several allegations online
about your father.

663
00:47:44,251 --> 00:47:46,891
Can you explain those as well?

664
00:47:50,199 --> 00:47:52,449
I'm sorry. No comment.

665
00:47:52,449 --> 00:47:56,474
Then what was CEO An's relationship
with your father?

666
00:47:56,474 --> 00:47:58,587
Is it true they had an affair?

667
00:47:58,587 --> 00:48:00,669
When did you find out?

668
00:48:00,669 --> 00:48:03,860
Do you feel any responsibility?

669
00:48:12,556 --> 00:48:14,352
It's An Su Hui!

670
00:48:27,531 --> 00:48:31,029
[Director Woo Soo Bin Press Conference]
[Official Statement]

671
00:48:34,559 --> 00:48:36,311
I've heard enough.

672
00:48:36,311 --> 00:48:40,102
You all heard that damn recording.

673
00:48:40,102 --> 00:48:42,565
And these are the questions you ask?

674
00:48:43,474 --> 00:48:46,598
I only found out he was married
after I got pregnant!

675
00:48:46,598 --> 00:48:48,482
I was a victim too.

676
00:48:48,482 --> 00:48:50,122
But you asked him to get divorced!

677
00:48:50,122 --> 00:48:51,939
Doesn't that mean you knew?

678
00:48:51,939 --> 00:48:54,279
Because I was keeping the baby.

679
00:48:54,279 --> 00:48:57,452
But that bastard refused,
no matter what I said.

680
00:48:59,962 --> 00:49:02,230
I haven't even started yet.

681
00:49:06,004 --> 00:49:07,241
Everyone.

682
00:49:07,241 --> 00:49:09,954
Back then, I was only 24, an actress.

683
00:49:09,954 --> 00:49:14,239
If word got out
that I had a child out of wedlock,

684
00:49:14,239 --> 00:49:15,591
I was finished.

685
00:49:15,591 --> 00:49:17,118
Completely finished.

686
00:49:17,118 --> 00:49:21,891
Now that I'm almost 60, this is nothing.

687
00:49:22,504 --> 00:49:25,918
I was going to let it die down.

688
00:49:26,758 --> 00:49:28,263
<i>But then...</i>

689
00:49:29,289 --> 00:49:34,659
<i>I didn't want to remain
a mother Ha Na would be ashamed of.</i>

690
00:49:35,472 --> 00:49:37,356
<i>I'll say this one last time.</i>

691
00:49:37,356 --> 00:49:40,128
<i>I didn't know that man was married.</i>

692
00:49:40,128 --> 00:49:44,269
He refused to divorce,
but still insisted I have the baby.

693
00:49:44,269 --> 00:49:46,172
So I had the baby.

694
00:49:48,235 --> 00:49:51,322
Then he took him away. That's all.

695
00:49:51,322 --> 00:49:54,745
The only person who gets to blame me now...

696
00:49:55,727 --> 00:49:57,767
is my daughter, Ha Na.

697
00:50:01,293 --> 00:50:03,591
That's it. I'm done.

698
00:50:29,203 --> 00:50:31,160
- Oh my...
- This is huge.

699
00:50:31,160 --> 00:50:32,950
Is this really about our hospital director?

700
00:50:32,950 --> 00:50:34,665
An affair with An Su Hui...

701
00:50:34,665 --> 00:50:37,350
- This is insane...
- Hey, hey!

702
00:50:43,938 --> 00:50:46,651
What's for lunch today?

703
00:50:46,651 --> 00:50:49,091
Neobiani and cabbage doenjang soup, I think...

704
00:50:49,091 --> 00:50:51,343
Yes. I believe so.

705
00:50:51,343 --> 00:50:54,968
But... are you eating at the cafeteria?

706
00:50:57,996 --> 00:50:59,500
Why?

707
00:50:59,500 --> 00:51:02,524
Is there a reason I shouldn't?

708
00:51:02,524 --> 00:51:04,068
No, sir.

709
00:51:09,858 --> 00:51:11,128
Hey.

710
00:51:11,128 --> 00:51:13,425
Isn't that An Su Hui?

711
00:51:14,626 --> 00:51:15,993
No way...

712
00:51:15,993 --> 00:51:18,895
Well, I think it is.

713
00:51:19,686 --> 00:51:22,560
She's got nerves of steel.

714
00:51:22,560 --> 00:51:26,005
Maybe she's just broken.

715
00:51:35,750 --> 00:51:37,314
Mom.

716
00:51:37,314 --> 00:51:39,048
I'm here.

717
00:51:59,912 --> 00:52:02,982
One more bowl of rice, please!

718
00:52:12,863 --> 00:52:15,617
I used to be the only customer here.

719
00:52:17,928 --> 00:52:20,790
I saw the press conference.

720
00:52:22,508 --> 00:52:24,272
You really lost it.

721
00:52:24,272 --> 00:52:25,905
I did.

722
00:52:25,905 --> 00:52:28,549
How else could I survive?

723
00:52:28,549 --> 00:52:30,325
Exactly.

724
00:52:31,156 --> 00:52:34,695
You must've been so lonely and hurt.

725
00:52:39,282 --> 00:52:42,049
You once told me

726
00:52:42,722 --> 00:52:45,609
that I didn't know real misery.

727
00:52:47,668 --> 00:52:51,541
I finally understand what you meant.

728
00:52:53,113 --> 00:52:54,965
I'm sorry.

729
00:52:59,680 --> 00:53:02,252
I said I didn't want you ashamed of me.

730
00:53:02,252 --> 00:53:05,684
I wasn't asking for pity.

731
00:53:05,684 --> 00:53:08,844
I don't pity you at all.

732
00:53:08,844 --> 00:53:11,420
I'm disappointed. And I hate you.

733
00:53:12,390 --> 00:53:14,870
But I love you just as much.

734
00:53:17,914 --> 00:53:21,976
I know you love me too.

735
00:53:23,041 --> 00:53:25,454
Just in your own way.

736
00:53:27,591 --> 00:53:28,598
Mom.

737
00:53:28,598 --> 00:53:34,835
Can't we just be
an ordinary mother and daughter?

738
00:53:38,671 --> 00:53:40,749
How do we do that?

739
00:53:40,749 --> 00:53:43,774
I never had that with my mother either.

740
00:53:44,456 --> 00:53:47,911
That's the first I've heard of Grandma.

741
00:53:52,671 --> 00:53:53,970
So...

742
00:53:54,730 --> 00:53:56,514
What do you want me to do first?

743
00:53:56,514 --> 00:53:58,388
Tell me.

744
00:53:58,388 --> 00:54:00,012
Just...

745
00:54:00,941 --> 00:54:03,373
Let me go a little.

746
00:54:03,373 --> 00:54:05,780
I want to try living on my own.

747
00:54:07,979 --> 00:54:10,649
Give me a chance to become an adult.

748
00:54:10,649 --> 00:54:12,573
You are an adult. You're 30.

749
00:54:12,573 --> 00:54:13,753
Exactly.

750
00:54:13,753 --> 00:54:17,210
I'm 30, and I can't do anything.

751
00:54:17,210 --> 00:54:19,100
I can't even make rice.

752
00:54:19,100 --> 00:54:21,178
I can't clean or do laundry.

753
00:54:21,178 --> 00:54:22,302
Why would you?

754
00:54:22,302 --> 00:54:24,181
I raised you so you'd never have to.

755
00:54:24,181 --> 00:54:26,804
Being able to do it but not doing it

756
00:54:26,804 --> 00:54:29,673
is different from not knowing how.

757
00:54:30,395 --> 00:54:32,207
Honestly...

758
00:54:33,296 --> 00:54:35,666
I'm ashamed of myself.

759
00:54:36,360 --> 00:54:38,086
Don't be ridiculous.

760
00:54:39,050 --> 00:54:40,713
You're spoiled.

761
00:54:40,713 --> 00:54:42,147
I am.

762
00:54:42,147 --> 00:54:46,609
So let me find out just how spoiled I've been.

763
00:54:48,076 --> 00:54:54,167
Even if I leave your side,
I'll always be your daughter.

764
00:54:54,167 --> 00:54:55,457
Who knows?

765
00:54:55,457 --> 00:54:58,540
Maybe we'll become closer.

766
00:55:01,645 --> 00:55:04,875
I thought you'd look worn down
after leaving home,

767
00:55:04,875 --> 00:55:07,294
but you've gained weight.

768
00:55:08,598 --> 00:55:12,105
I'm turning your room into my home gym.

769
00:55:12,105 --> 00:55:16,121
Don't come crawling back later.

770
00:55:53,896 --> 00:55:56,815
You're being completely unreasonable.

771
00:55:56,815 --> 00:55:59,035
Why should Director Ian step down?

772
00:55:59,035 --> 00:56:01,820
He took the bullet for you!

773
00:56:01,820 --> 00:56:03,322
CEO Seo!

774
00:56:03,322 --> 00:56:08,115
Making a statement doesn't mean
telling the whole truth.

775
00:56:08,115 --> 00:56:13,062
He should've spun it with a few lies.

776
00:56:13,062 --> 00:56:14,958
Now people are even more worked up!

777
00:56:14,958 --> 00:56:17,002
It's embarrassing...

778
00:56:17,002 --> 00:56:19,004
Then...

779
00:56:19,004 --> 00:56:21,156
If we cover it up with lies now,

780
00:56:21,156 --> 00:56:23,302
how do we deal with the fallout later?

781
00:56:23,302 --> 00:56:25,380
That's their problem.

782
00:56:25,380 --> 00:56:29,465
Why should we take on that risk?

783
00:56:29,465 --> 00:56:34,944
The director, investor, and actress
being family already looks bad.

784
00:56:34,944 --> 00:56:38,477
Now it's been framed
as some trashy family drama.

785
00:56:38,477 --> 00:56:40,301
How does that fit this film?

786
00:56:40,301 --> 00:56:42,266
What if I step down?

787
00:56:47,606 --> 00:56:50,425
When did you get here? Let's talk outside.

788
00:56:54,560 --> 00:56:56,562
If I step down,

789
00:56:58,601 --> 00:57:04,565
can Director Ju Yi Jae continue the film?

790
00:57:27,754 --> 00:57:29,700
Are you okay?

791
00:57:29,700 --> 00:57:31,359
Those reporters were awful.

792
00:57:31,359 --> 00:57:34,518
Why were they attacking you? You didn't...

793
00:57:46,505 --> 00:57:50,237
Nothing's wrong, right?

794
00:57:51,687 --> 00:57:53,558
We can still make our film...

795
00:57:53,558 --> 00:57:55,077
I love you.

796
00:57:56,435 --> 00:57:57,995
Yi Jae.

797
00:58:00,647 --> 00:58:02,437
Me too.

798
00:58:02,437 --> 00:58:04,431
I love you too.

799
00:58:06,945 --> 00:58:08,952
Then that's enough.

800
00:59:13,850 --> 00:59:16,781
[Director Dismissal Review and Approval]
<i>You need to make the best choice now.</i>

801
00:59:16,781 --> 00:59:19,963
<i>And the best choice is removing Director Woo?</i>

802
00:59:19,963 --> 00:59:21,466
<i>Wait, CEO An!</i>

803
00:59:21,466 --> 00:59:23,933
<i>We won't shoot without him.</i>

804
00:59:23,933 --> 00:59:25,492
<i>Your father has cancer.</i>

805
00:59:25,492 --> 00:59:27,359
[You're Invited to a Special Screening]
<i>For ten years, I only had one hour.</i>

806
00:59:27,359 --> 00:59:29,496
<i>- Now I get two full hours onscreen.
- Really?</i>

807
00:59:29,496 --> 00:59:32,337
<i>Is it always this scary after the final shoot?</i>

808
00:59:32,337 --> 00:59:34,654
<i>I don't want to settle here.
I want to learn more.</i>

809
00:59:34,654 --> 00:59:35,667
<i>Should I study abroad?</i>

810
00:59:35,667 --> 00:59:38,078
<i>You're my dream, Ju Yi Jae.</i>

811
00:59:38,078 --> 00:59:40,202
<i>Don't go, Yi Jae.</i>
